  "details": "The Enchanted Broom is the most enjoyable experience I've had in VRChat so far. Flying freely and smoothly through large worlds felt incredible, and it let me see and enjoy worlds made by creators in a completely new way.\n\nSince it's only available during the Halloween event, I'd love to see it become a permanent item, or return in the future (for example as a seasonal item, or a VRC+ or Marketplace item). I'd also be very happy to see more items with this kind of fun, free-movement design.\n\nThank you to the whole team for this wonderful item!",
